### Start Process
POST http://localhost:8155/api/orders/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "O-100",
  "customerName": "John Doe"
}

### Get Tasks
GET http://localhost:8155/api/orders/tasks

### Complete Task (Approved)
# Replace {taskId} with actual ID from GET response
POST http://localhost:8155/api/orders/tasks/{taskId}/complete?approved=true
